                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Game is broken and I'm stuck at level 3.\nThis is happening to other people in different levels too.\nNo answer or any kind of comment from the dev/publisher.\nThe game might be fun but I'll only know if and when they fix it.\nUntil then, thumbs down all the way.\nInclined to ask for refund since I'm not sure the game will ever work properly.\n0/10 - For the lack of interest from the dev/publisher.\n\nEDIT Feb 22nd:\n\nA patch has been released and the game is working so far. Hope the bug was fixed for good.\nWill update this review once I finish the game to reflect how I feel about it and not just it's problems.\n\nEDIT March 15th:\n\nWas able to play up to level 26. Now everytime I try to start level 27 the game crashes.\n\nEDIT April 8th:\n\nWas able to start level 27 but can't finish it since there are new bugs and my minions won't complete their tasks.",
